From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:40:19 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 103/144] GreatDANE: finish the update-check declaration:
 pepecoin.surf only, Dane as receiver (NGD final ruling + coordinator)

- PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy comment:
  - The ruling sentence names https://pepecoin.surf/dane/update/, the masked IP (/24 or /48), the user agent and
    path, about 14-day retention, and use for app functionality only.
  - The "Mozilla is the receiving party" header now carries the exception that Dane (pepecoin.surf) receives the
    update-check data.
  - The OtherDiagnosticData bullet lists the Dane update-check log.
- PRIVACY-MANIFEST.md:
  - Same Dane-as-receiver exception in the intro.
  - NGD's exact text, with one coordinator-approved deviation: "Dane's update server (pepecoin.surf)" instead of
    "update servers (pepecoin.surf, dogecoin.surf)", because dogecoin.surf only 301-redirects (Curb Appeal).
  - A plain statement that entries before Nov 10 kept full IPs until about Nov 25.
  - The table row says "declared".
- The plist values are unchanged: OtherDiagnosticData stays not linked, not tracking, AppFunctionality +
  Analytics (Analytics is for the opt-in telemetry). No CoarseLocation or ProductInteraction change.
---
 greatdane/macos/PRIVACY-MANIFEST.md   | 12 +++++++++---
 greatdane/macos/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy | 22 +++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

